# Compiled class file
*.class

# Log file
*.log

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Mobile Tools for Java (J2ME)
.mtj.tmp/

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Kotlin Gradle plugin data, see https://kotlinlang.org/docs/whatsnew20.html#new-directory-for-kotlin-data-in-gradle-projects
.kotlin/

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
local.properties

# Deliberate, flagged exception to the blanket *.jar rule above and to CLAUDE.md §10.10
# (no committed binaries): the Gradle wrapper jar is standard practice and is required for a
# reproducible build without relying on a pre-installed Gradle on the machine that checks it out.
# It is verifiable, not merely trusted: its sha256 is
# 497c8c2a7e5031f6aa847f88104aa80a93532ec32ee17bdb8d1d2f67a194a9c7, matching Gradle's own published
# wrapper checksum for 9.6.1 (https://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-9.6.1-wrapper.jar.sha256).
# See docs/adr/012-build-and-test-tooling.md and this project's build-skeleton PR body.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
